\begin{enumerate}
\item Then $v(\sigma(\mathcal{A}))= T_m(v(\mathcal{A}))$ ($T_m$ is as defined in Definition  \ref{aliA}).
\item  $\mathcal{B}(\vec{\lambda},\ell)$ is indivisible as a grade zero line bundle if and only if
